{"id":181636077619803,"type":"artist","name":"Iván","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":12,"info":{"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/3cb1f9dd96aa6a566aa3865814d450d7/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"Se conocen al menos 2 artistas con el nombre de Iván, ambos españoles y se relacionan de acuerdo a su popularidad:\n\n\n1.-Iván (exitoso en los años 80's en España y Latinoamerica):\n\nIván fue uno de los cantantes de moda a principio de los años 80, los días de los club de fans, sus póster no faltaban en las habitaciones y con sus fotos se forraban las carpetas de las jóvenes de la época.\nCanciones como: Sin amor, Por una vez mas, Es, Te agradezco, Chica misteriosa, Fotonovela… Sonaban en los cassetes y en las emisoras.","tags":["pop","electronic","spain","spanish","italo-disco"]},"works":[{"id":167324982366910,"type":"song","name":"Sin Amor (Dghingis Khan)","artist":"Iván","year":1979,"weight":2,"yt":null,"src":"charts","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":23636244894326,"name":"Spain Singles Chart","rank":1,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":124809167912030,"type":"song","name":"Sin amor","artist":"Iván","year":1979,"weight":2,"yt":"9gjcBGjUtO0","src":"singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":122421116346264,"name":"Los 40 nº1 · 1979","rank":23,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":251412534638119,"type":"song","name":"Sin Amor (Dschinghis Khan)","artist":"Iván","year":1980,"weight":2,"yt":null,"src":"charts","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":23636244894326,"name":"Spain Singles Chart","rank":1,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":131100105335580,"type":"song","name":"Te quiero tanto","artist":"Iván","year":1981,"weight":4,"yt":"OVzzb5XlpfU","src":"charts,singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":86836110995513,"name":"Los 40 nº1 · 1981","rank":12,"scaruffi":null},{"id":23636244894326,"name":"Spain Singles Chart","rank":1,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":226782647938846,"type":"song","